{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"球谱"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"球谱"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you (like many people working in homotopy theory and/or higher category theory and/or homotopy type theory) think that <strong>spaces are the real fundamental objects and sets are just the reflective subcategories of $0$-truncated space</strong>, then the role usually played by $\\mathbb{Z}$ in traditional set-based mathematics is now played by $\\mathbb S$, and $\\mathbb Z$ only appear as the $0$-truncation of $\\mathbb S$.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>有限集合与双射的范畴 $\\mathsf{Fin}^\\simeq$ 作为生象等价于 $\\coprod_{n\\geq 0}B\\Sigma_n$, 其"},{"Local":{"url":"群化","text":"群化"}},{"Plain":"为 $\\operatorname{colim}_{k\\to\\infty}\\Omega^k S^k \\simeq \\Omega^\\infty \\mathbb S$.</p>\n"}]}}